  Id: active_camouflage
  DisplayName: Active Camouflage
  RulesText: "Armour with this feature is more difficult to see due to the way it
    manipulates light. \nWhile this model has fully charged Energy Shields (the amount
    of shields it starts with, not including purchased upgrades) you may not draw
    LOS to it unless:\nYou are in an adjacent or same cube, then Ranged Attacks will
    be at a -2 modifier whilst this model has fully charged shields.\nIf this model
    does not have fully charged shields then you may draw LOS to it as usual, however
    ranged attacks will be at a -1 modifier against it. \nIf a model with no shields
    gains Active Camouflage, Ranged Attacks will be at a -1 modifier against this
    model and you may draw LOS to it as usual.\nDecember Eratta 2025*\n"
